WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 36=

5
02:13.620 --> 02:14.547
(I have borne our ancestors' burden for 41 years.)

6
02:14.548 --> 02:15.660
(I took office young, but corrected my faults, growing more cautious.)

7
02:19.640 --> 02:22.640
My father plans to pass the throne to Mu Xun?

8
02:28.250 --> 02:29.850
The Crown Prince was deposed and confined.

9
02:31.570 --> 02:34.010
Yet you're the son His Majesty summons time and again.

10
02:34.970 --> 02:36.010
Do you think Mu Xun

11
02:36.850 --> 02:37.410
will let you go

12
02:38.810 --> 02:40.090
once he takes the throne?

13
02:43.010 --> 02:43.920
Given the Crown Prince's nature,

14
02:45.320 --> 02:46.570
even if my father never summoned me,

15
02:47.570 --> 02:49.160
he'd never let me go.

16
02:50.410 --> 02:50.720
Your Highness.

17
02:52.130 --> 02:53.640
His Majesty knows his days are numbered,

18
02:54.160 --> 02:55.480
so he had me draft this edict

19
02:55.850 --> 02:57.250
and hide it in his chamber.

20
02:58.090 --> 02:58.920
The moment

21
02:59.640 --> 03:01.600
His Majesty sends this decree

22
03:01.880 --> 03:03.410
to the Chancellery,

23
03:04.160 --> 03:04.850
there'll be

24
03:05.850 --> 03:07.810
no turning back.

25
03:10.370 --> 03:11.410
Mr. Liu, please save me.

26
03:13.200 --> 03:14.440
If I didn't want to help you,

27
03:15.090 --> 03:17.090
I wouldn't have come today, Your Highness.

28
03:17.570 --> 03:17.850
Here.

29
03:21.600 --> 03:22.200
But

30
03:23.040 --> 03:24.640
do you really want to turn things around?

31
03:26.010 --> 03:27.640
More than anything.

32
03:28.090 --> 03:29.250
I want to live!

33
03:30.440 --> 03:31.040
Then

34
03:33.440 --> 03:34.850
you'll have to do something big.

35
03:47.320 --> 03:47.760
Your Highness.

36
03:48.720 --> 03:49.850
May I borrow your writing implements?

37
04:05.530 --> 04:07.640
Why did His Majesty suddenly summon me?

38
04:07.850 --> 04:09.290
Chancellor Liu, you'd best ask His Majesty yourself.

39
04:09.880 --> 04:10.850
I'm just a palace eunuch.

40
04:14.160 --> 04:14.690
Summon

41
04:15.090 --> 04:16.050
the Vice Chief of the Secretariat,

42
04:16.250 --> 04:16.930
the Chief of the Secretariat,

43
04:17.320 --> 04:18.280
the Vice Chief of the Chancellery,

44
04:18.440 --> 04:19.250
the Supervising Secretary,

45
04:19.520 --> 04:20.810
and the Left and Right Grand Remonstrants

46
04:21.080 --> 04:22.130
to the palace at once.

47
04:22.810 --> 04:25.250
I have urgent matters to discuss with you all in private.

48
04:25.690 --> 04:28.320
No delay. Let no word leak out!

49
04:35.080 --> 04:36.960
What... what's going on?

50
04:38.170 --> 04:38.570
(Universe in Harmony) Look.

51
04:38.730 --> 04:39.050
This is...?

52
04:45.130 --> 04:46.610
His Majesty's condition has suddenly worsened.

53
04:47.200 --> 04:48.050
The last edict has been issued.

54
04:48.280 --> 04:48.960
The last edict?

55
04:49.520 --> 04:50.250
Hear the edict.

56
04:51.400 --> 04:52.520
Without the Secretariat and Chancellery,

57
04:53.280 --> 04:54.250
how can this be called an edict?

58
04:54.640 --> 04:55.080
Exactly.

59
04:55.760 --> 04:57.050
Does the Princess Regent know?

60
04:57.640 --> 04:59.280
Where is Chancellor Liu?

61
04:59.840 --> 05:00.379
- Exactly! - Right!

62
05:00.421 --> 05:01.039
We want to see Chancellor Liu!

63
05:01.081 --> 05:01.819
Where is Chancellor Liu?

64
05:01.861 --> 05:02.829
We must see Chancellor Liu!

65
05:02.870 --> 05:04.159
- We want to see Chancellor Liu! - Let us see Chancellor Liu!

66
05:04.201 --> 05:04.869
Who do you think you are?

67
05:04.911 --> 05:05.721
Let us see Chancellor Liu!

68
05:06.010 --> 05:06.930
Outrageous!

69
05:08.960 --> 05:10.400
- Let us see Chancellor Liu! - We want to see Chancellor Liu!

70
05:10.840 --> 05:11.669
Who do you think you are?

71
05:11.710 --> 05:12.529
We'll hear what Chancellor Liu says!

72
05:12.571 --> 05:13.229
Let us see Chancellor Liu!

73
05:13.271 --> 05:13.799
Bring Chancellor Liu out!

74
05:13.841 --> 05:14.471
We want to see Chancellor Liu!

75
05:15.280 --> 05:16.080
Bring Chancellor Liu out!

76
06:34.340 --> 06:36.980
(The empire teeters on the brink. The Prince of Jin usurps the throne.)

77
07:03.740 --> 07:08.780
(Weizhou, Hanbei Circuit, Border of Hanbei)

78
07:20.440 --> 07:21.610
Weizhou is just ahead.

79
07:22.080 --> 07:22.440
Ruozhu,

80
07:22.960 --> 07:24.810
we can stop in the city for a day

81
07:25.080 --> 07:25.690
to celebrate your birthday.

82
07:27.370 --> 07:27.840
Dear.

83
07:28.640 --> 07:29.170
Wait.

84
07:33.250 --> 07:33.730
What's wrong?

85
07:34.250 --> 07:36.200
I'm sure I heard the evening drum marking the You hour.

86
07:37.490 --> 07:39.250
Why are the city gates still open?

87
07:39.930 --> 07:41.170
Maybe we're lucky

88
07:41.640 --> 07:43.490
and can get in to rest today.

89
08:04.810 --> 08:05.440
Dear.

90
08:06.810 --> 08:07.370
What's wrong?

91
08:11.840 --> 08:12.760
(Weizhou) Weizhou has fallen.

92
08:13.490 --> 08:14.690
The longer we keep the news under wraps,

93
08:15.250 --> 08:16.840
the better our chances.

94
08:17.200 --> 08:18.170
Now we join forces

95
08:19.250 --> 08:20.080
and march day and night

96
08:20.840 --> 08:21.520
straight for Sheng'an.

97
08:22.170 --> 08:22.610
Let's go.

98
08:29.440 --> 08:30.730
Something this big happened in Weizhou.

99
08:31.400 --> 08:32.450
Why no beacon smoke?

100
08:33.250 --> 08:34.040
If that's the case,

101
08:35.010 --> 08:36.400
it may not be just one prefecture that's fallen.

102
08:37.400 --> 08:38.520
It may be the entire Hanbei Circuit.

103
08:40.560 --> 08:42.490
We need to get word to the neighboring prefectures fast.

104
08:42.920 --> 08:43.800
If war breaks out again,

105
08:44.040 --> 08:44.640
Weizhou

106
08:45.130 --> 08:46.280
and Hanbei Circuit won't be

107
08:46.640 --> 08:47.490
the only places affected.

108
08:48.130 --> 08:49.640
Since they've killed all the city guards,

109
08:50.130 --> 08:51.760
the beacon tower officers and men

110
08:52.730 --> 08:53.920
must be dead too.

111
08:56.130 --> 08:56.850
What do we do?

112
09:05.210 --> 09:06.010
There's a small path here.

113
09:06.490 --> 09:07.400
We can go around this way

114
09:07.760 --> 09:08.880
and get there half a day sooner.

115
09:12.520 --> 09:13.250
Why is there a beacon fire?

116
09:13.730 --> 09:14.250
(Wang Chengding, Hanbei Military Governor) Who lit it?

117
09:14.640 --> 09:15.010
General.

118
09:15.330 --> 09:16.450
We've wiped out the beacon guards.

119
09:16.730 --> 09:17.610
The wolf dung's been cleared out too.

120
09:18.370 --> 09:19.330
(Tan Yuanchun, Handong Military Governor) I'll take some men back to check.

121
09:29.250 --> 09:30.520
We've burned so many books.

122
09:31.090 --> 09:32.730
Can the people in the neighboring prefectures see the flames?

123
09:35.130 --> 09:36.560
Bamboo slips are no match for firewood and wolf dung.

124
09:37.090 --> 09:38.800
Let's burn more, and faster.

125
09:41.210 --> 09:42.450
We've carried these all this way.

126
09:42.970 --> 09:43.640
Scroll by scroll.

127
09:44.130 --> 09:44.760
Box by box.

128
09:45.370 --> 09:45.970
Today,

129
09:46.610 --> 09:48.010
they've finally served their purpose.

130
09:48.760 --> 09:49.970
Books are only things, after all.

131
09:50.280 --> 09:52.640
Once printed, their words will live on for generations.

132
09:53.520 --> 09:54.730
We can always collect more later.

133
09:57.280 --> 09:57.779
Hurry! Over here!

134
09:57.821 --> 09:58.351
- Ruozhu! - They're here!

135
09:58.450 --> 09:58.739
This way!

136
09:58.781 --> 09:59.151
Hurry!

137
10:01.460 --> 10:04.110
♪I ride through endless sands without rest♪

138
10:04.160 --> 10:04.560
Ruozhu.

139
10:05.280 --> 10:06.880
To have known you in this life,

140
10:07.800 --> 10:08.800
I can die without regret.

141
10:10.040 --> 10:11.130
We'll walk the road

142
10:11.172 --> 10:13.490
♪Frost stains my sleeves; the setting sun lights towers♪

143
10:15.040 --> 10:16.130
to the underworld together.

144
10:16.172 --> 10:18.320
♪Wild geese fly south through late autumn♪

145
10:18.920 --> 10:21.400
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

146
10:21.450 --> 10:23.450
I wondered who had caused all this trouble.

147
10:24.090 --> 10:25.880
Just two commoners.

148
10:26.490 --> 10:27.610
Not afraid to die, are you?

149
10:27.652 --> 10:30.960
♪Let the storms sweep the hills bare; still, I cling to dreams of home♪

150
10:31.010 --> 10:31.610
We dared to

151
10:31.890 --> 10:33.710
♪If one day my homeland calls, my heart stays true♪

152
10:33.760 --> 10:35.330
light the beacon fire here today

153
10:36.760 --> 10:38.280
knowing you'd find us,

154
10:39.640 --> 10:41.370
and knowing we'd die here!

155
10:41.412 --> 10:45.060
♪Whose eyes have seen the smoke of war?♪

156
10:45.110 --> 10:47.400
♪I'll ride into battle♪

157
10:47.450 --> 10:47.880
Lin Dao.

158
10:49.040 --> 10:49.490
Lin Dao?

159
10:50.640 --> 10:51.010
Lin Dao!

160
10:51.052 --> 10:52.450
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

161
10:54.280 --> 10:54.880
Lin Dao.

162
10:55.800 --> 10:56.370
Lin Dao.

163
10:56.412 --> 10:57.260
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

164
10:57.320 --> 11:00.250
♪May you live a life free of sorrow♪

165
11:01.610 --> 11:02.610
What are you waiting for?

166
11:02.652 --> 11:03.960
♪May the moon shine on us forever♪

167
11:04.010 --> 11:05.450
Kill me already!

168
11:09.130 --> 11:10.280
You're...?

169
11:16.520 --> 11:17.730
Chancellor Liu once did me a favor.

170
11:18.280 --> 11:18.850
I won't kill you.

171
11:19.090 --> 11:20.450
I know your voice.

172
11:22.520 --> 11:23.730
Tan Yuanchun.

173
11:25.040 --> 11:28.280
Why put on this show of compassion?

174
11:30.970 --> 11:31.680
Leave a squad behind.

175
11:32.450 --> 11:33.520
Put out that beacon fire at once.

176
11:39.610 --> 11:40.250
Lin Dao.

177
11:42.420 --> 11:47.058
(County Office)

178
11:47.100 --> 11:51.790
(County Office)

179
11:51.850 --> 11:52.730
Yang Si is ridiculous.

180
11:55.210 --> 11:56.400
Still drinking and not back yet.

181
11:57.040 --> 11:58.210
Does he not want to go back to Sheng'an?

182
12:04.760 --> 12:05.210
Yan Shang.

183
12:06.490 --> 12:07.040
Look north.

184
12:08.970 --> 12:09.560
What's that?

185
12:13.920 --> 12:14.680
A beacon fire.

186
12:15.370 --> 12:16.250
Coming from Hanbei Circuit.

187
12:20.330 --> 12:21.210
How many men do you have?

188
12:21.730 --> 12:22.680
We need to find Yang Si fast.

189
12:23.280 --> 12:24.040
If he comes back to your place...

190
12:28.400 --> 12:28.800
No.

191
12:31.160 --> 12:32.130
He didn't lose track of time.

192
12:33.160 --> 12:34.040
He left on purpose.

193
12:35.610 --> 12:36.640
So that beacon fire

194
12:37.210 --> 12:38.210
has to do with the deposed Crown Prince?

195
12:39.730 --> 12:40.760
I have to get back to Sheng'an at once.

196
12:41.090 --> 12:41.450
Wait.

197
12:48.760 --> 12:49.680
If Yang Si is compromised,

198
12:50.090 --> 12:52.250
then the attendants you brought can't be trusted either.

199
12:53.560 --> 12:54.970
Should I report this to the prefecture first?

200
12:55.330 --> 12:56.160
Our Military Governor

201
12:56.450 --> 12:58.640
may be able to hold off Hanbei Circuit for a while.

202
12:59.520 --> 12:59.850
No.

203
13:01.450 --> 13:03.040
I knew the generals of both circuits.

204
13:04.160 --> 13:05.330
The Military Governor of Hannan Circuit

205
13:05.560 --> 13:07.090
has always been closely allied with Hanbei.

206
13:08.010 --> 13:09.280
If Wang Chengding of Hanbei rebels,

207
13:09.730 --> 13:10.880
it'll be a blessing if Hannan

208
13:11.250 --> 13:12.010
doesn't join him.

209
13:15.760 --> 13:16.130
Yan Shang.

210
13:16.680 --> 13:17.250
We must hurry.

211
13:37.210 --> 13:37.680
Lin Dao.

212
13:39.210 --> 13:39.760
Lin Dao.

213
13:45.210 --> 13:47.160
You scared me to death.

214
13:49.850 --> 13:50.880
Sorry to worry you.

215
14:13.100 --> 14:15.740
(Ancient Chu Musical Scores)

216
14:17.330 --> 14:19.560
Why do you carry bamboo slips with you?

217
14:21.160 --> 14:23.210
They took the brunt of the arrow for you.

218
14:26.850 --> 14:28.040
Ancient Chu Musical Scores.

219
14:29.560 --> 14:30.040
I was going to

220
14:31.280 --> 14:32.730
surprise you with them.

221
14:33.450 --> 14:33.970
Tomorrow

222
14:35.370 --> 14:36.490
is your birthday.

223
14:45.880 --> 14:46.560
All right.

224
15:20.560 --> 15:21.400
Who goes there?

225
15:39.370 --> 15:40.090
Wait for me.

226
15:41.730 --> 15:42.349
Don't run.

227
15:42.391 --> 15:43.511
Get home quick.

228
15:43.610 --> 15:44.370
Slow down.

229
15:45.490 --> 15:46.899
Come take a look!

230
15:46.941 --> 15:48.941
Hot steamed buns.

231
15:49.490 --> 15:52.010
Fresh out of the steamer.

232
15:53.370 --> 15:54.490
Come take a look!

233
15:55.730 --> 15:56.560
What would you like?

234
15:58.880 --> 16:00.160
Come take a look.

235
16:01.400 --> 16:02.130
Take care.

236
16:02.330 --> 16:03.010
Greens.

237
16:05.040 --> 16:06.160
Fresh greens.

238
16:14.680 --> 16:15.970
(Wang's Tea Shop, Plain Silk Shop) Very fresh!

239
16:41.800 --> 16:42.760
Why were you following me?

240
16:43.450 --> 16:46.210
Someone important sent me to deliver this to you.

241
17:13.490 --> 17:14.450
(The empire is on the brink.)

242
17:15.360 --> 17:17.450
(I've secretly summoned Tan Yuanchun of Handong Circuit)

243
17:18.250 --> 17:19.560
(and Wang Chengding of Hanbei Circuit)

244
17:20.080 --> 17:20.930
(to rise and support me.)

245
17:22.280 --> 17:23.120
(When you see this letter,)

246
17:24.650 --> 17:26.840
(if you still remember the years we rode side by side)

247
17:27.890 --> 17:29.600
(and pity my desperate plight,)

248
17:30.970 --> 17:31.800
(go to Hanbei at once)

249
17:33.040 --> 17:34.490
(to meet Tan and Wang's cavalry)

250
17:35.010 --> 17:36.040
(and march west toward Sheng'an.)

251
17:37.650 --> 17:38.520
(If it's too hard for you,)

252
17:38.890 --> 17:39.730
(then forget it.)

253
17:40.040 --> 17:42.010
(I won't blame you.)

254
17:42.760 --> 17:43.690
(Two beacon fires)

255
17:44.650 --> 17:45.650
(will soon be lit.)

256
17:46.600 --> 17:48.360
(You must leave that dangerous place at once.)

257
17:50.040 --> 17:51.120
(Fate closes in.)

258
17:51.760 --> 17:52.210
(I)

259
17:52.600 --> 17:53.690
(have no other way.)

260
17:55.840 --> 17:57.690
(And I must act on my own.)

261
17:59.410 --> 18:00.410
(The jade pendant enclosed)

262
18:01.280 --> 18:03.010
(is the one I wore when we hunted together at the Shangsi Festival.)

263
18:03.800 --> 18:04.760
(It stands in my stead.)

264
18:05.560 --> 18:06.410
(Please take care.)

265
18:35.600 --> 18:36.360
The jade pendant here

266
18:36.970 --> 18:37.890
is as good as the Crown Prince himself.

267
18:41.080 --> 18:41.600
Rise, both of you.

268
18:44.040 --> 18:44.800
This pendant is the proof.

269
18:45.600 --> 18:46.800
His Royal Highness has put me in charge of this campaign

270
18:47.360 --> 18:49.250
and ordered me to meet your troops and march west toward Sheng'an.

271
18:50.800 --> 18:51.560
It's come to this.

272
18:52.600 --> 18:53.250
No turning back now.

273
18:53.800 --> 18:54.490
No room for error.

274
18:55.360 --> 18:56.890
His Royal Highness has entrusted us with his life.

275
18:57.250 --> 18:58.170
We'll do our utmost.

276
18:58.930 --> 18:59.280
Generals,

277
19:00.080 --> 19:01.600
we are not to lay siege to cities or engage in battle.

278
19:02.650 --> 19:04.010
Avoid any obstacles along the way whenever possible.

279
19:04.360 --> 19:05.210
Travel light.

280
19:05.560 --> 19:06.930
Reach Tongguan within ten days.

281
19:08.490 --> 19:10.210
And keep your soldiers in line.

282
19:11.970 --> 19:12.560
Those who delay will be

283
19:13.360 --> 19:13.650
executed.

284
19:14.170 --> 19:15.010
Those who leak word will be

285
19:15.800 --> 19:16.120
executed.

286
19:16.650 --> 19:17.450
Those who shrink back will be

287
19:18.280 --> 19:18.600
executed!

288
19:19.840 --> 19:22.120
Generals, I hope we will work together with one purpose.

289
19:23.450 --> 19:23.890
- Yes! - Yes!

290
19:27.410 --> 19:28.040
There's one more thing

291
19:28.840 --> 19:30.170
you need to know.

292
19:32.120 --> 19:33.760
The Princess Regent left the capital with me in disguise.

293
19:34.320 --> 19:35.730
She's currently within Lanyang County.

294
19:36.250 --> 19:37.010
Route the two armies around.

295
19:38.120 --> 19:39.080
Do not disturb her.

296
19:44.080 --> 19:45.080
Rest assured.

297
19:45.690 --> 19:46.970
His Royal Highness knows this puts you in a hard spot.

298
19:47.730 --> 19:49.490
Yesterday, he secretly ordered me to send an elite force

299
19:50.800 --> 19:51.210
to capture

300
19:51.840 --> 19:52.560
Princess Danyang.

301
19:53.930 --> 19:54.490
What?

302
19:57.320 --> 19:57.890
(Lanyang County Office) Search everywhere!

303
19:58.360 --> 19:58.989
Yes, sir!

304
19:59.031 --> 20:00.749
Search every room thoroughly!

305
20:00.791 --> 20:01.481
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

306
20:01.970 --> 20:02.730
You guys, over there!

307
20:03.410 --> 20:04.080
You, go that way!

308
20:04.250 --> 20:04.600
Yes, sir!

309
20:05.040 --> 20:05.800
Search carefully!

310
20:06.760 --> 20:07.280
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

311
20:08.250 --> 20:09.560
Everyone keep your eyes peeled!

312
20:09.930 --> 20:11.320
Search every corner carefully!

313
20:11.760 --> 20:12.019
Yes, sir!

314
20:12.061 --> 20:12.781
Search carefully!

315
20:13.010 --> 20:13.320
Hurry!

316
20:14.080 --> 20:14.760
Nothing, sir.

317
20:15.250 --> 20:15.600
Nothing!

318
20:17.890 --> 20:19.450
Sir, we've searched everywhere. Nothing.

319
20:21.520 --> 20:22.930
Seal the city gates. No one in or out!

320
20:23.450 --> 20:24.450
We must find them!

321
20:24.840 --> 20:25.320
Yes, sir!

322
20:25.490 --> 20:25.760
Move!

323
20:31.360 --> 20:31.730
(Donglang,)

324
20:32.650 --> 20:33.250
(after I leave,)

325
20:33.560 --> 20:35.080
(go take shelter at the charity school)

326
20:35.520 --> 20:36.280
(at once.)

327
20:37.040 --> 20:37.520
Mr. Yan,

328
20:38.170 --> 20:39.040
please stay safe.

329
20:48.730 --> 20:49.490
Once we're over this mountain,

330
20:49.800 --> 20:51.410
we'll reach the main road, and we can ride from there.

331
20:52.560 --> 20:54.650
How do you know roads like this?

332
20:55.010 --> 20:55.800
Thanks to you,

333
20:56.360 --> 20:57.760
I've been here for three years.

334
20:58.360 --> 21:00.320
I know every hill and stream like the back of my hand.

335
21:01.210 --> 21:01.690
Almost there.

336
21:02.040 --> 21:02.840
The trail down is just ahead.

337
21:04.450 --> 21:05.250
Surround the woods!

338
21:05.650 --> 21:06.410
Search every inch!

339
21:06.890 --> 21:07.450
Report anything unusual

340
21:07.650 --> 21:08.250
at once!

341
21:08.450 --> 21:09.170
Yes, sir!

342
21:11.320 --> 21:12.120
They've sealed off the mountain.

343
21:13.250 --> 21:14.210
My brother

344
21:15.080 --> 21:16.520
has always been ruthless.

345
21:17.840 --> 21:18.930
Sure enough, he won't let me

346
21:19.560 --> 21:20.970
make it back to Sheng'an alive.

347
21:58.760 --> 22:00.080
Who's there at this hour?

348
22:00.360 --> 22:01.320
We're just passing through.

349
22:01.600 --> 22:02.650
We need your help.

350
22:06.800 --> 22:07.410
Sir.

351
22:11.730 --> 22:12.930
Who are you looking for?

352
22:13.650 --> 22:15.650
We got lost in the mountains.

353
22:16.320 --> 22:17.410
We're hoping to stay the night.

354
22:22.490 --> 22:23.210
Come... come in.

355
22:23.730 --> 22:24.210
Thank you.

356
22:24.320 --> 22:24.730
Thank you.

357
22:36.560 --> 22:37.840
Are you two husband and wife?

358
22:38.840 --> 22:39.189
Yes.

359
22:39.231 --> 22:39.621
No.

360
22:46.490 --> 22:47.320
To be honest,

361
22:48.170 --> 22:49.210
we

362
22:49.730 --> 22:51.320
are not married yet.

363
22:52.040 --> 22:53.250
But we're already engaged.

364
22:55.210 --> 22:56.970
My father is a snob.

365
22:57.080 --> 22:57.930
He wants to break it off.

366
22:58.760 --> 22:59.970
So we ran away.

367
23:00.760 --> 23:02.010
We didn't dare take the official road,

368
23:02.410 --> 23:03.730
so we tried the mountain paths.

369
23:04.690 --> 23:05.520
But we got lost.

370
23:07.210 --> 23:07.730
Sir.

371
23:08.250 --> 23:09.120
We'll leave at dawn.

372
23:09.320 --> 23:10.410
We won't trouble you.

373
23:11.210 --> 23:11.760
But

374
23:12.280 --> 23:13.080
if anyone asks,

375
23:13.650 --> 23:15.650
please say you never saw us.

376
23:15.970 --> 23:16.450
Yes.

377
23:17.080 --> 23:17.930
If we're caught,

378
23:18.210 --> 23:19.360
my father will beat me to death.

379
23:20.450 --> 23:21.280
Helping someone in need

380
23:21.730 --> 23:22.930
is a good deed.

381
23:34.360 --> 23:35.730
Please take this money.

382
23:36.010 --> 23:37.080
For letting us stay the night.

383
23:37.840 --> 23:38.490
Put it away.

384
23:38.800 --> 23:39.690
We can't take this.

385
23:39.890 --> 23:40.760
We can't.

386
23:41.040 --> 23:42.560
Alright. Have a seat.

387
23:42.800 --> 23:43.280
Come on, sit.

388
23:43.970 --> 23:44.450
Have a seat.

389
23:47.210 --> 23:47.490
I...

390
23:47.600 --> 23:48.210
Let's go.

391
23:48.450 --> 23:49.010
Let's get dinner ready.

392
23:49.120 --> 23:50.170
- No, I was just... - Those two kids must be

393
23:50.250 --> 23:51.360
starving and exhausted.

394
23:51.690 --> 23:52.490
Let's get dinner ready.

395
24:04.040 --> 24:05.080
You're quite the liar.

396
24:08.040 --> 24:08.890
They've sealed off the mountain.

397
24:09.490 --> 24:10.170
Now they'll search it.

398
24:11.600 --> 24:13.690
Who knows how far they'll get tonight?

399
24:17.890 --> 24:18.650
If we hear anything,

400
24:18.930 --> 24:19.760
we'll leave at once.

401
24:20.210 --> 24:21.410
We can't drag them into this.

402
24:54.490 --> 24:55.280
I'll go get some water.

403
24:58.410 --> 24:59.080
Doesn't he look like him?

404
24:59.450 --> 25:00.360
I think so too.

405
25:00.490 --> 25:01.520
It's definitely him.

406
25:02.450 --> 25:03.450
I've never mistaken anyone.

407
25:03.800 --> 25:04.890
That is Magistrate Yan.

408
25:05.560 --> 25:06.280
Keep it down.

409
25:06.410 --> 25:07.360
Don't let them hear you.

410
25:08.040 --> 25:09.600
When we cook porridge for them later,

411
25:09.930 --> 25:10.360
we'll just...

412
25:22.560 --> 25:23.360
They've recognized you.

413
25:24.010 --> 25:24.360
Let's go.

414
25:25.120 --> 25:25.450
Wait.

415
25:26.560 --> 25:27.560
This is Lanyang territory.

416
25:27.930 --> 25:29.170
It's no surprise the locals know me.

417
25:29.730 --> 25:30.930
Even if they recognize me,

418
25:31.320 --> 25:32.760
that doesn't mean they'll tell the pursuers.

419
25:33.760 --> 25:34.760
They clearly recognized you,

420
25:34.930 --> 25:35.730
yet they're still keeping it from you

421
25:36.280 --> 25:38.080
and plan to tamper with our food.

422
25:38.600 --> 25:39.520
What do you think they're planning?

423
25:41.170 --> 25:42.280
Are we really going to stake our lives

424
25:42.520 --> 25:43.650
on their conscience?

425
25:47.360 --> 25:47.800
Let's go.

426
26:15.450 --> 26:15.930
Sir.

427
26:16.690 --> 26:17.170
Eat up.

428
26:20.520 --> 26:22.170
Then get some rest early.

429
26:46.520 --> 26:47.040
Not poisoned.

430
26:53.320 --> 26:54.120
Hurry up and eat.

431
26:54.560 --> 26:56.560
Don't let them see we're eating something different.

432
27:04.840 --> 27:05.360
Sir.

433
27:06.040 --> 27:06.560
What are you...?

434
27:14.840 --> 27:15.730
To be honest,

435
27:16.210 --> 27:16.970
that is all the rice

436
27:18.250 --> 27:19.450
we have left.

437
27:20.080 --> 27:21.250
Just enough for two bowls of porridge.

438
27:21.840 --> 27:22.890
We're old.

439
27:23.520 --> 27:24.170
We can't digest that.

440
27:24.760 --> 27:25.800
This is fine for us.

441
27:46.490 --> 27:46.760
Here.

442
27:47.600 --> 27:48.280
You two eat.

443
27:48.600 --> 27:49.690
We made it for you.

444
27:50.120 --> 27:50.760
We're not hungry.

445
27:51.800 --> 27:52.560
Have some more.

446
27:55.170 --> 27:57.170
I've been drinking this wild greens soup since I was little.

447
27:59.760 --> 28:00.410
I'll try some too.

448
28:05.650 --> 28:06.760
I can tell this young lady

449
28:07.650 --> 28:09.080
comes from a wealthy family.

450
28:09.520 --> 28:10.520
She won't be used to it.

451
28:11.040 --> 28:11.600
I can handle it.

452
28:20.970 --> 28:21.520
Sir.

453
28:23.170 --> 28:24.600
You recognized me,

454
28:25.320 --> 28:26.600
so why didn't you tell us?

455
28:27.970 --> 28:28.560
Magistrate Yan,

456
28:30.040 --> 28:30.690
I

457
28:31.490 --> 28:32.520
may be old,

458
28:33.450 --> 28:34.930
but I can handle things.

459
28:36.690 --> 28:39.360
You and this young lady came into the mountains late at night,

460
28:39.930 --> 28:41.930
covered in dirt

461
28:42.520 --> 28:43.490
and in such a hurry.

462
28:43.930 --> 28:44.490
I figured

463
28:44.890 --> 28:45.539
you must be

464
28:45.581 --> 28:47.991
in some trouble you couldn't tell others about.

465
28:48.280 --> 28:49.690
I didn't want to pry.

466
28:51.450 --> 28:51.930
Thank you.

467
28:55.080 --> 28:55.600
I'm sorry.

468
28:59.490 --> 29:00.280
I kept things from you too.

469
29:07.520 --> 29:08.280
Magistrate Yan.

470
29:09.760 --> 29:10.970
Let me ask just one thing.

471
29:11.890 --> 29:13.080
Once you go down this mountain,

472
29:13.840 --> 29:15.280
you're out of Lanyang County.

473
29:15.560 --> 29:15.890
Are you

474
29:17.040 --> 29:18.080
really leaving?

475
29:18.800 --> 29:19.360
We're so sorry.

476
29:19.890 --> 29:20.520
Really.

477
29:21.080 --> 29:22.690
We have nothing to send you off with.

478
29:23.450 --> 29:24.690
You didn't even have your fill.

479
29:25.210 --> 29:25.760
We did.

480
29:27.250 --> 29:27.840
Thank you, ma'am.

481
29:28.650 --> 29:29.450
Magistrate Yan.

482
29:32.250 --> 29:33.560
Will you come back?

483
29:36.410 --> 29:37.730
The crops

484
29:39.360 --> 29:40.730
haven't even ripened yet this year.

485
29:43.010 --> 29:44.080
Enough.

486
29:46.120 --> 29:47.800
They must have something important to do.

487
29:58.010 --> 29:58.650
This way!

488
29:59.250 --> 29:59.579
Everyone!

489
29:59.621 --> 30:00.549
Yes, sir!

490
30:00.591 --> 30:01.311
Don't let them get away!

491
30:01.360 --> 30:02.170
Search thoroughly!

492
30:04.930 --> 30:05.600
Over here!

493
30:06.250 --> 30:06.690
Coming!

494
30:06.970 --> 30:07.360
Coming! After them!

495
30:07.490 --> 30:08.059
They're closing in.

496
30:08.101 --> 30:08.541
Move it!

497
30:08.760 --> 30:09.170
Come on.

498
30:09.560 --> 30:10.210
You two, come with me.

499
30:10.410 --> 30:11.170
Hurry. Quick!

500
30:12.840 --> 30:13.120
Let's go.

501
30:13.210 --> 30:13.650
Come on.

502
30:13.840 --> 30:14.840
Get inside. Quick.

503
30:15.010 --> 30:15.280
Hurry.

504
30:15.730 --> 30:17.410
Lie down and pull the covers over you.

505
30:17.650 --> 30:18.280
Don't make a sound.

506
30:18.690 --> 30:20.560
Just pretend you're my son and daughter-in-law.

507
30:20.890 --> 30:21.840
Stay in bed and keep quiet.

508
30:23.600 --> 30:24.210
Don't make a sound!

509
30:33.490 --> 30:34.120
Move it!

510
30:34.450 --> 30:34.930
Keep up!

511
30:35.450 --> 30:35.760
Hurry!

512
30:38.600 --> 30:40.250
A young couple in their twenties.

513
30:40.930 --> 30:41.410
Have you seen them?

514
30:41.890 --> 30:42.890
N-No, we haven't.

515
30:43.600 --> 30:45.600
We hardly see strangers around here.

516
30:45.970 --> 30:46.730
Is that so?

517
30:48.410 --> 30:49.410
We can't drag them into this.

518
30:52.280 --> 30:52.930
Out the window.

519
30:54.690 --> 30:55.040
- Let's go. - Move aside!

520
31:10.650 --> 31:11.410
Who lives in this room?

521
31:13.280 --> 31:14.730
My son and daughter-in-law.

522
31:24.360 --> 31:25.280
Your son and daughter-in-law?

523
31:26.450 --> 31:26.890
Well,

524
31:27.040 --> 31:28.800
they usually live here.

525
31:29.170 --> 31:31.040
They went into town to buy goods today.

526
31:36.650 --> 31:37.080
Yan Shang.

527
31:37.410 --> 31:38.170
We have to split up.

528
31:38.360 --> 31:40.170
Your Highness, are you worried they're after you

529
31:40.600 --> 31:41.279
and don't want to drag me down?

530
31:41.321 --> 31:41.891
What else?

531
31:42.210 --> 31:43.040
You're a minor official.

532
31:43.170 --> 31:44.040
Why would they search for you?

533
31:44.410 --> 31:44.800
Too late.

534
31:45.490 --> 31:47.170
Didn't you hear them ask about two people?

535
31:47.840 --> 31:48.280
You and I

536
31:48.890 --> 31:49.600
are together.

537
31:51.320 --> 31:52.840
Someone's over there! Everyone, follow me!

538
31:53.280 --> 31:53.930
Everyone, keep up!

539
31:54.120 --> 31:55.339
Yes, sir!

540
31:55.381 --> 31:55.951
Keep up!

541
31:57.170 --> 31:58.360
Hurry! Keep up!

542
31:58.450 --> 31:58.739
Keep up!

543
31:58.781 --> 31:59.581
I'm afraid

544
32:00.970 --> 32:01.970
I can't save you this time.

545
32:05.890 --> 32:06.890
Who goes there? Stop!

546
32:27.800 --> 32:28.120
Squad Leader.

547
32:29.450 --> 32:30.010
The portraits are here.

548
32:30.560 --> 32:31.520
Compare their faces.

549
33:10.930 --> 33:11.650
You live in the mountains?

550
33:13.490 --> 33:13.930
Yes.

551
33:14.650 --> 33:15.760
We're mountain folk.

552
33:16.210 --> 33:17.840
We were slow getting home today,

553
33:18.210 --> 33:18.909
so it got late.

554
33:18.951 --> 33:19.621
Nonsense!

555
33:20.040 --> 33:21.600
Coming home in the dead of night?

556
33:26.210 --> 33:27.560
Weren't those two old folks just now

557
33:28.760 --> 33:30.560
waiting for their son and daughter-in-law to come home?

558
33:44.840 --> 33:45.890
Quit standing there!

559
33:46.210 --> 33:47.080
Keep searching!

560
33:48.560 --> 33:49.799
Then... what about these two...?

561
33:49.841 --> 33:50.691
Have you finished searching everywhere else?

562
33:57.840 --> 33:58.170
Yes, sir.

563
33:59.490 --> 34:00.080
Keep searching!

564
34:01.010 --> 34:01.600
Yes, sir!

565
34:17.010 --> 34:17.640
Aren't you leaving?

566
34:18.160 --> 34:19.080
Why didn't you expose us?

567
34:28.930 --> 34:29.850
Forgive my rudeness just now.

568
34:30.520 --> 34:30.850
Your Highness.

569
34:32.040 --> 34:32.680
You recognize me?

570
34:33.520 --> 34:34.370
You are the Princess Regent.

571
34:39.040 --> 34:39.520
Rise.

572
34:44.450 --> 34:45.370
You have portraits.

573
34:45.930 --> 34:46.930
Why not compare our faces

574
34:47.520 --> 34:48.330
and turn us in for the reward?

575
34:48.720 --> 34:49.600
I know what you look like.

576
34:50.810 --> 34:51.680
No need for portraits.

577
34:54.040 --> 34:55.160
We've already searched this area.

578
34:55.970 --> 34:56.930
You can go down the mountain this way.

579
34:57.600 --> 34:58.560
You'll avoid the search parties.

580
35:01.490 --> 35:02.240
Why help us?

581
35:02.970 --> 35:03.930
Your Highness, you may not know me,

582
35:05.200 --> 35:06.330
but I could never forget you.

583
35:06.770 --> 35:07.640
In the 23rd year of Yingxiang,

584
35:08.120 --> 35:09.080
you ordered every military commander

585
35:09.810 --> 35:10.640
to bring a squad of soldiers

586
35:10.970 --> 35:12.450
to the capital for the assembly.

587
35:13.930 --> 35:14.600
I went along too.

588
35:15.160 --> 35:16.520
That's when I learned you wanted to ask us

589
35:17.930 --> 35:19.080
whether back pay had been issued

590
35:19.560 --> 35:20.600
and whether our families had been provided for.

591
35:21.680 --> 35:22.200
That's when I learned

592
35:23.040 --> 35:24.770
the order for garrison farming to support the troops was from you.

593
35:26.160 --> 35:26.890
That year,

594
35:28.370 --> 35:29.770
I'd actually been ready to desert.

595
35:31.560 --> 35:33.520
But then our pay suddenly came through.

596
35:34.120 --> 35:35.200
So my parents didn't starve

597
35:36.680 --> 35:37.290
and I didn't become a bandit.

598
35:38.810 --> 35:39.240
Your Highness.

599
35:40.240 --> 35:41.640
We soldiers have only had enough to eat

600
35:42.560 --> 35:43.450
for the past three years.

601
35:44.720 --> 35:45.290
What's your name?

602
35:46.080 --> 35:47.290
I'm helping you for my own sake.

603
35:51.850 --> 35:52.850
I just want to live in peace.

604
35:53.810 --> 35:54.890
I don't want to be caught up in another war.

605
35:56.810 --> 35:58.120
In the armies across the prefectures and circuits,

606
35:59.810 --> 36:01.370
there are thousands of insignificant soldiers

607
36:02.890 --> 36:03.680
like me.

608
36:18.040 --> 36:18.370
Let's go.

609
36:30.040 --> 36:30.410
Halt!

610
37:07.010 --> 37:07.520
Yang Si

611
37:08.160 --> 37:09.330
pays his respects to the Crown Prince!

612
37:10.970 --> 37:13.160
Welcome, Your Royal Highness!

613
37:48.520 --> 37:49.410
What is troubling you?

614
37:52.370 --> 37:53.160
At this point,

615
37:53.680 --> 37:54.370
is there anything

616
37:55.120 --> 37:56.080
we can't speak openly about?

617
37:56.640 --> 37:57.600
I'm just thinking

618
37:59.330 --> 38:01.330
the drought in Hannan and Hanbei

619
38:02.290 --> 38:03.450
and the other circuits hasn't eased yet.

620
38:04.160 --> 38:05.040
Raising troops now

621
38:05.240 --> 38:06.240
will throw the realm into chaos.

622
38:06.930 --> 38:09.010
The court's relief efforts may not continue.

623
38:10.370 --> 38:11.120
Far more

624
38:11.600 --> 38:13.120
innocent people may die

625
38:13.890 --> 38:15.330
from natural disasters

626
38:16.120 --> 38:17.080
than on the battlefield.

627
38:17.450 --> 38:17.850
That's true.

628
38:18.450 --> 38:19.240
With natural disasters raging

629
38:19.560 --> 38:20.330
and public resentment boiling,

630
38:21.080 --> 38:22.490
the prefectures are already overwhelmed.

631
38:23.410 --> 38:24.330
This is the best time

632
38:25.290 --> 38:26.600
for me to raise troops.

633
38:26.810 --> 38:27.490
Heaven itself

634
38:28.490 --> 38:29.600
is on my side.

635
38:35.640 --> 38:36.330
Do you know

636
38:37.330 --> 38:37.930
where Wanyao is?

637
38:40.970 --> 38:41.520
I don't.

638
38:47.040 --> 38:48.160
Wanyao may be a woman,

639
38:49.600 --> 38:50.720
but she's not to be underestimated.

640
38:51.520 --> 38:53.450
With her in the picture, anything could happen.

641
38:54.370 --> 38:55.330
Once I capture her,

642
38:56.330 --> 38:57.600
you can plead for her then.

643
38:59.680 --> 39:00.010
Alright.

644
39:01.370 --> 39:02.930
Go bring Wang Chengding and Tan Yuanchun in.

645
39:03.890 --> 39:05.040
We need to discuss

646
39:05.970 --> 39:06.890
our marching strategy.

647
39:07.290 --> 39:07.810
Your Highness.

648
39:08.890 --> 39:09.579
Is there

649
39:09.621 --> 39:10.831
really no other way?

650
39:24.080 --> 39:24.770
To think

651
39:25.450 --> 39:26.450
you're still this naive

652
39:27.930 --> 39:29.370
after all this time.

653
39:29.890 --> 39:30.450
Your Highness.

654
39:31.720 --> 39:33.410
Whenever I think of the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors,

655
39:34.330 --> 39:35.560
it feels like it happened yesterday.

656
39:35.970 --> 39:38.080
The realm has only enjoyed a few years of peace...

657
39:38.370 --> 39:39.160
Yang Si!

658
39:39.810 --> 39:41.450
We've already raised troops.

659
39:43.370 --> 39:44.640
There's no turning back.

660
39:46.890 --> 39:48.680
If we back down now,

661
39:49.010 --> 39:50.810
everyone out there dies!

662
39:52.850 --> 39:54.040
If they don't want to die,

663
39:54.450 --> 39:55.970
they'll have to kill you and me first!

664
39:57.080 --> 39:58.930
We have no other choice.

665
39:59.520 --> 40:00.080
Yang Si,

666
40:00.520 --> 40:01.970
look at me now.

667
40:04.970 --> 40:06.240
I've been confined for three years.

668
40:07.040 --> 40:08.770
Every day was sheer torture.

669
40:09.490 --> 40:10.810
But I survived.

670
40:11.450 --> 40:12.560
Because this throne

671
40:12.930 --> 40:13.640
and this realm

672
40:14.240 --> 40:16.930
are what I've sacrificed everything

673
40:17.080 --> 40:19.290
and schemed half my life for!

674
40:19.770 --> 40:21.770
I am Huai's rightful heir.

675
40:24.080 --> 40:24.970
But now,

676
40:25.370 --> 40:26.219
the throne is about

677
40:26.261 --> 40:27.911
to fall to that fool, the Prince of Jin!

678
40:28.490 --> 40:29.040
Tell me,

679
40:30.330 --> 40:31.680
how can I accept that?

680
40:38.640 --> 40:40.410
I'm just taking back

681
40:41.330 --> 40:43.330
what he stole from me.

682
40:45.040 --> 40:46.200
That's all.

683
40:52.240 --> 40:52.680
Any

684
40:54.770 --> 40:55.810
more questions?

685
41:16.520 --> 41:17.600
When did you learn to ride?

686
41:20.450 --> 41:22.450
It's been three years. I had to pick up a few skills.

687
41:23.040 --> 41:23.810
Lanyang may be small,

688
41:24.040 --> 41:25.370
but it's still too big to get around on foot.

689
41:26.240 --> 41:26.850
Riding a horse

690
41:27.370 --> 41:28.560
isn't much different from riding a donkey.

691
41:32.080 --> 41:32.970
Where are we now?

692
41:33.810 --> 41:34.850
We've passed Mount Xiao.

693
41:35.520 --> 41:37.010
Another two or three days, and we'll reach the capital.

694
41:39.640 --> 41:42.010
Along the way, the prefectures and counties have been quiet.

695
41:42.640 --> 41:43.010
Either

696
41:43.410 --> 41:45.120
we've left the rebels behind,

697
41:45.600 --> 41:46.010
or...

698
41:46.640 --> 41:47.410
They've turned their coat.

699
41:56.330 --> 41:57.720
How did he escape?

700
41:58.290 --> 41:59.200
That's impossible.

701
42:00.160 --> 42:01.389
He's been locked up for three years.

702
42:01.431 --> 42:03.581
He's practically lost his mind.

703
42:05.160 --> 42:06.930
(Universe in Harmony) Did he grow wings and fly away?

704
42:07.680 --> 42:09.200
And end up at the Jinwu Guard's camp?

705
42:10.560 --> 42:12.640
Speak! Cat got your tongue?

706
42:14.930 --> 42:15.640
Calm down, Your Highness.

707
42:17.240 --> 42:17.720
Everyone out.

708
42:19.010 --> 42:19.389
Yes.

709
42:19.431 --> 42:21.181
What exactly happened?

710
42:21.290 --> 42:21.640
Your Highness.

711
42:22.520 --> 42:23.560
I've got to the bottom of it.

712
42:24.040 --> 42:24.770
Then say it!

713
42:25.080 --> 42:27.770
The former palace eunuchs from the Eastern Palace joined forces

714
42:28.120 --> 42:29.810
to help the deposed Crown Prince escape to the Jinwu Guard.

715
42:30.330 --> 42:31.080
The deposed Crown Prince

716
42:31.450 --> 42:33.720
had put a lot of effort into the Jinwu Guard's left camp.

717
42:34.450 --> 42:36.080
And now he's colluded with rebels there,

718
42:36.490 --> 42:37.240
left the capital overnight,

719
42:37.600 --> 42:38.200
and headed south.

720
42:41.410 --> 42:42.640
He ran?

721
42:46.200 --> 42:47.490
Good!

722
42:50.200 --> 42:51.970
I thought he was planning something.

723
42:53.160 --> 42:56.120
That guy always looked down on me.

724
42:56.720 --> 42:57.789
Three years in prison

725
42:57.831 --> 42:59.701
must have scared him out of his wits.

726
42:59.970 --> 43:01.080
All he wants is to save his own skin.

727
43:02.810 --> 43:05.930
Turns out he's nothing but a coward.

728
43:08.640 --> 43:11.770
You always say you've got everything handled.

729
43:12.810 --> 43:14.450
Something this serious happened,

730
43:14.970 --> 43:16.410
and you knew nothing about it?

731
43:21.080 --> 43:21.970
Once I...

732
43:22.490 --> 43:22.810
Wait!

733
43:24.850 --> 43:25.370
The first thing

734
43:26.330 --> 43:27.330
I'll do

735
43:28.040 --> 43:29.490
after taking the throne

736
43:30.080 --> 43:31.890
is hunt down that traitor,

737
43:32.200 --> 43:32.770
Mu Xun!

738
43:33.450 --> 43:35.040
Report!

739
43:35.850 --> 43:36.200
Your Highness!

740
43:36.330 --> 43:37.080
What now?

741
43:37.810 --> 43:38.770
(Universe in Harmony) The capital garrison reports

742
43:39.040 --> 43:40.240
that the deposed Crown Prince has left the capital with his troops.

743
43:40.330 --> 43:42.720
He's joined forces with the rebel armies from Handong and Hanbei!

744
43:43.290 --> 43:44.240
Now he's turned west.

745
43:44.680 --> 43:46.970
He may be planning to take the Tongguan route back to Sheng'an!

746
43:48.450 --> 43:49.490
He's coming back?

747
43:50.080 --> 43:50.810
What should we do?

748
43:51.080 --> 43:51.850
Your orders, please!

749
43:57.290 --> 43:57.720
What's the panic?

750
43:58.200 --> 43:58.560
Get out!

751
43:59.240 --> 43:59.560
Yes!

752
44:02.330 --> 44:02.810
Mr. Liu.

753
44:04.040 --> 44:05.200
You have to save me.

754
44:06.120 --> 44:06.770
He's coming back...

755
44:07.450 --> 44:08.909
He's coming back to take my throne!

756
44:08.951 --> 44:10.951
He... he's going to kill me!

757
44:13.930 --> 44:14.330
Alright.

758
44:15.240 --> 44:15.890
I won't take

759
44:16.450 --> 44:17.330
the throne.

760
44:17.890 --> 44:18.520
I'll... I'll...

761
44:18.640 --> 44:20.600
I'll just give it back to him!

762
44:30.970 --> 44:31.450
Your Highness.

763
44:33.810 --> 44:34.930
At this point,

764
44:36.640 --> 44:37.890
you have no choice.

765
44:39.720 --> 44:41.330
You're going to be the Emperor

766
44:42.410 --> 44:43.160
whether you like it

767
44:43.930 --> 44:44.970
or not.

768
44:45.890 --> 44:46.970
If you ascend the throne first,

769
44:47.640 --> 44:48.770
he'll be a traitor.

770
44:49.520 --> 44:50.930
But if the Eastern Palace is restored,

771
44:52.080 --> 44:53.330
you'll be the traitor.

772
44:54.720 --> 44:55.450
Between you and him,

773
44:56.640 --> 44:57.520
only one gets to survive!

774
44:59.010 --> 44:59.520
Understand?

775
45:02.970 --> 45:04.160
The coronation will be tomorrow.

776
45:04.850 --> 45:05.450
Keep it simple.

777
45:08.490 --> 45:09.200
By order of the Crown Prince,

778
45:09.600 --> 45:11.970
the Shence Army shall assemble at once and march to Tongguan

779
45:12.520 --> 45:13.490
to crush the rebels!

780
45:14.640 --> 45:15.770
The deposed Crown Prince, Mu Xun,

781
45:16.410 --> 45:17.520
is ruthless

782
45:17.850 --> 45:18.640
and seeks to destroy the realm.

783
45:19.200 --> 45:20.240
His head must be hung at the palace gates

784
45:20.890 --> 45:21.970
to uphold the law!

785
45:24.780 --> 45:28.820
(Next Episode Preview)

786
45:29.200 --> 45:30.240
I urge Your Majesty

787
45:30.810 --> 45:34.040
and the Retired Emperor to go south at once.

788
45:34.240 --> 45:34.680
I,

789
45:35.520 --> 45:36.930
Yan Shang, Magistrate of Lanyang,

790
45:38.370 --> 45:40.200
volunteer to defend Sheng'an.

791
45:45.681 --> 45:48.974
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

792
45:51.659 --> 45:56.575
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

793
45:58.769 --> 46:04.614
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

794
46:05.114 --> 46:10.340
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

795
46:13.109 --> 46:17.900
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

796
46:18.736 --> 46:24.815
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

797
46:26.616 --> 46:29.766
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

798
46:29.766 --> 46:31.414
♪Burning bright as a song♪

799
46:31.466 --> 46:35.190
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

800
46:35.568 --> 46:40.234
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

801
46:40.853 --> 46:44.894
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

802
46:45.385 --> 46:47.500
♪Not a single hour less♪

803
46:47.540 --> 46:54.486
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

804
46:55.249 --> 46:58.702
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

805
46:58.882 --> 47:02.027
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

806
47:02.466 --> 47:09.103
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

807
47:09.500 --> 47:11.538
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

808
47:11.538 --> 47:14.014
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

809
47:14.052 --> 47:16.521
♪You're the only one I need♪

810
47:16.725 --> 47:23.612
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

811
47:23.924 --> 47:27.195
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

812
47:27.500 --> 47:30.673
♪My last untouched innocence♪

813
47:30.997 --> 47:34.423
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

814
47:34.656 --> 47:37.881
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

815
47:38.212 --> 47:45.008
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

816
47:45.377 --> 47:47.439
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

817
47:47.440 --> 47:49.943
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

818
47:49.990 --> 47:52.328
♪You're the only one I need♪

819
47:52.559 --> 47:59.394
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

820
47:59.743 --> 48:01.361
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

821
48:01.491 --> 48:03.287
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

822
48:03.644 --> 48:06.661
♪You're the only one I need♪

823
48:06.701 --> 48:08.028
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
